Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.7 009/274] crypto: ccp -- don't "select" CONFIG_DMADEVICES
Date:   Mon,  8 Jun 2020 19:01:42 -0400
Message-Id: <20200608230607.3361041-9-sashal@kernel.org>
